118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (The Content Monetization Modeler is a machine learning project developed using Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn, and Streamlit to predict YouTube advertisement revenue based on video and channel characteristics such as views, watch time, subscribers, category, device, and country. The project involves data preprocessing, exploratory data analysis, feature engineering, and Linear Regression model development to generate accurate revenue predictions. The trained model is deployed through an interactive Streamlit application, enabling users to estimate potential earnings instantly and helping content creators make informed, data-driven decisions to optimize their content strategy and maximize monetization opportunities.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
